{"id":"n69858-1-8","stage":4,"title":"원료 · 原料","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69858-1-8-1","ko":"요즘 밀가루 가격이 엄청 올랐습니다.","zh":"最近面粉的价格涨得非常厉害。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"밀가루","meaning":"面，面粉","explanation":"밀가루：面，面粉。","readings":[{"term":"밀가루","audio":"/audio/db2374a87cd050f03efb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57411","senseId":"1","lemma":"밀가루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밀가루","audio":"/audio/db2374a87cd050f03efb.mp3"}},{"text":"가격이","meaning":"价格，价钱","explanation":"가격：价格，价钱；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가격","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62450","senseId":"1","lemma":"가격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가격이","audio":"/audio/a02ba08407432d2f7b81.mp3"}},{"text":"엄청","meaning":"相当，特别","explanation":"엄청：相当，特别。","readings":[{"term":"엄청","audio":"/audio/31ff8e60cae7be0afe40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67346","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄청","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄청","audio":"/audio/31ff8e60cae7be0afe40.mp3"}},{"text":"올랐습니다.","meaning":"上升，上涨","explanation":"오르다：上升，上涨；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"오르다","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69518","senseId":"10","lemma":"오르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올랐습니다","audio":"/audio/cca65a3345ac7ea0d841.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"db2374a87cd050f0","term":"밀가루",