tionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올랐으니","audio":"/audio/87e50739394948be2dde.mp3"}},{"text":"앞으로","meaning":"以后，未来","explanation":"앞：以后，未来；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"4","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞으로","audio":"/audio/cb4897c6b6949e02da6d.mp3"}},{"text":"빵도","meaning":"面包","explanation":"빵：面包；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"빵","audio":"/audio/edc73c627b8f32b7f6a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23402","senseId":"1","lemma":"빵","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빵도","audio":"/audio/86f0fbe2bc4101f676fe.mp3"}},{"text":"비싸지겠네요.","meaning":"贵；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"비싸다：贵；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"비싸다","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66318","senseId":"1","lemma":"비싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비싸지겠네요","audio":"/audio/0f521e121b110d0a0ece.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"edc73c627b8f32b7","term":"빵","zh":"面包","audio":"/audio/edc73c627b8f32b7f6a1.mp3","entryId":"23402","definition":"将面粉揉和并使之发酵后，蒸或烤而成的食物。","pronunciation":["빵"]},{"id":"767d1d8e31b2fce9","term":"원료","zh":"原料","audio":"/audio/767d1d8e31b2fce920cb.mp3","entryId":"69858","definition":"制造某个东西时所用的材料。","pronunciation":["월료"]},{"id":"38c1b40757a204e5","term":"가격","zh":"价格，价钱","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3","entryId":"62450","definition":"用钱表示的物品的价值。","pronunciation":["가격"]},{"id":"8fdeb9822b3fa061","term":"오르다","zh":"上升，上涨","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3","entryId":"69518","definition":"价格、数值、温度、成绩等比以前多或高。","pronunciation":["오르다"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"以后，未来","audio":"/audio/ec